@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Privacy Policy for ALVOCOR LLC, including information collected through contact forms, analytics, cookies, third-party links, and contact details.";
    ViewData["CanonicalPath"] = "/Privacy";
}

<section class="page-hero small-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Privacy</div>
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-0">ALVOCOR LLC respects your privacy and handles business inquiries responsibly.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container privacy-content">
        <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> June 2026</p>

        <h2>Information Collected</h2>
        <p>ALVOCOR LLC may collect information you choose to provide, including your name, email address, phone number, company name, location, service interests, and details about a project or business inquiry.</p>

        <h2>Contact Forms</h2>
        <p>If a contact form is enabled, submitted information may be used to respond to your inquiry, schedule conversations, prepare estimates, provide services, and maintain business records. Do not submit confidential or sensitive information through a website form unless a separate agreement is in place.</p>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>This website may use basic analytics tools to understand aggregate traffic, page usage, referring websites, device types, and browser information. Analytics information is used to improve website performance and content.</p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>The website may use cookies or similar technologies for basic functionality, analytics, security, or user experience improvements. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

        <h2>How Information Is Used</h2>
        <p>Information may be used to respond to inquiries, communicate about services, plan or deliver consulting engagements, improve the website, meet legal obligations, and protect the business from misuse or security issues.</p>

        <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
        <p>ALVOCOR LLC does not sell personal information. Information may be shared with service providers when needed to operate the website, communicate with you, deliver requested services, or comply with legal requirements.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>This website may link to third-party websites, including LinkedIn, GitHub, cloud providers, or other resources. ALVOCOR LLC is not responsible for the privacy practices or content of third-party websites.</p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>Reasonable safeguards are used to protect information submitted to ALVOCOR LLC, but no method of electronic transmission or storage is completely secure.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this Privacy Policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:alex@alvocor.com">alex@alvocor.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
</section>
